# The P4-C package is verified byte-for-byte by its MANIFEST.json (SHA-256 per file). Never let git normalise line
# endings here, on any checkout, or the recorded hashes stop matching.
* -text
# Vendored frozen material (byte-exact copies of P2-A, P3-A, the brand master and G3.2's reviewed prototype) is
# evidence and is never normalised, so git's whitespace checks do not apply to it.
source/vendor/** -whitespace
prototype/g3.2/** -whitespace
